    {
      "cn_text": "随着国际教育市场扩大,近期在主要英语国家学习的国际学生数量放缓的态势可能持续,尤其是在缺乏有效战略政策阻止这种下滑的情况下。",
      "en_text": "As the international education market expands, the recent slowdown in the number of international students studying in the main English-speaking countries is likely to continue, especially if there are no effective strategic policies to prevent such slippage.",
