    {
      "cn_text": "本研究对需求可能变化的预判意义重大:它为所有致力于推广英语学习和使用的组织提供了基础,以便规划应对可能截然不同的运营环境。",
      "en_text": "The anticipation of possible shifts in demand provided by this study is significant: It gives a basis to all organisations which seek to promote the learning and use of English, a basis for planning to meet the possibilities of what could be a very different operating environment.",
